              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kiruogindet Magdiel, kiruogindet Iram: chuto ko kiruogikab Edom, ko u meng’otenywa eng’ emet ne ki nenywa: nito ko Esau kwandab Edomik.",
          "type": "text",
